{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51741","headline":"徵李怀杲（一作果）嘲道门 一 · 光业","name":"徵李怀杲（一作果）嘲道门 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云锁涪江水似天，又闻怀杲已升仙。\n强思齐见应催胆，张茂卿闻必耸肩（强与张二玄士）。\n三尺霜刀（一作锋）充绦节，两条朱棒替香烟。\n报伊广德先生道，社稷威灵不偶然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"光业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}